  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to deny, to negate, to reject",
      "explanation": "To refuse to acknowledge or accept something as true or valid."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "06063_hiteisuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{彼|かれ}は{噂|うわさ}を{否定|ひてい}した。",
      "english": "He denied the rumor.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06063_hiteisuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{可能性|かのうせい}を{否定|ひてい}することはできない。",
      "english": "We cannot deny the possibility.",
      "notes": "Double negative - common pattern",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06063_hiteisuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{自分|じぶん}を{否定|ひてい}しないでください。",
      "english": "Please don't deny/reject yourself.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06063_hiteisuru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{会社|かいしゃ}はその{報道|ほうどう}を{否定|ひてい}した。",
      "english": "The company denied the news report.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06063_hiteisuru_ex5",
      "japanese": "{否定|ひてい}も{肯定|こうてい}もしないまま、{彼|かれ}は{黙|だま}っていた。",
      "english": "Without either denying or confirming, he remained silent.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: Xを{否定|ひてい}する (deny X / negate X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates state. {否定|ひてい}している = 'denies' or 'is denying.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{完全|かんぜん}に{否定|ひてい}する (completely deny)\n・{否定|ひてい}も{肯定|こうてい}もしない (neither deny nor confirm)\n・{頭|あたま}ごなしに{否定|ひてい}する (flatly deny)\n\nGRAMMAR: The noun {否定|ひてい} is used in grammatical terminology: {否定形|ひていけい} (negative form).",
